- `GET /assets/consentmgmt/truendo/jsons/{jsonId}/de` — Get German language consent management JSON data.
- `GET /combo` — Retrieve combined data (alternative endpoint).
- `GET /combo/` — Retrieve combined data from various sources.
- `GET /o/{oId}` — Get details for a specific object by its ID.
- `GET /o/frontend-js-web/liferay/available_languages.jsp` — Get a list of available languages for the frontend.
- `GET /stadtplan/{stadtplanId}` — Retrieve a specific city map by its ID.
- `GET /stadtplan/ajax/{ajaxId}` — Retrieve data via AJAX for the city map.

### Config (1)
- `GET /assets/consentmgmt/truendo/configs/{configId}/rules.json` — Retrieve consent management rules configuration.

